   CL4  "cmmu[0] is the instruction CMMU, cmmu[1] the data CMMU (memory_m88k.c:112's index)"
          -> data rows (cmmu[1]) and ifetch pfsr/pfar (cmmu[0])
   CL5  "the other CMMU is not written"            -> uld/ust/vme/luna icmmu, ifetch dcmmu
